{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Step into the Unknown</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/extras/56e0eb8cae46d1b8535c13bbb73e3a43.poster.avif?t=1773858175\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/extras/56e0eb8cae46d1b8535c13bbb73e3a43.webm?t=1773858175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/extras/56e0eb8cae46d1b8535c13bbb73e3a43.mp4?t=1773858175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You push open a half-closed door, the floor beneath your feet glinting cold in the dim light. The air is thick with the scent of dust and old paper, each step feeling like a trespass into untouched time. The corridor twists and winds ahead, shadows swaying on the walls. You can\u2019t foresee what lies beyond\u2014only your instincts and a faint glimmer will guide you forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock the Mechanisms</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/extras/f55316cf15929f19fc32d89030b02113.poster.avif?t=1773858175\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/extras/f55316cf15929f19fc32d89030b02113.webm?t=1773858175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/extras/f55316cf15929f19fc32d89030b02113.mp4?t=1773858175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The path ahead is blocked not only by rusted locks but by secrets long buried. You turn a combination lock, study the subtle grooves of its numbers, and wait for that barely audible <i>click</i>. Each puzzle solved peels back another layer of fog, revealing new paths\u2014and truths\u2014hidden within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Firepower Counterattack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/extras/84879ff841245217b9bc129eb517546f.poster.avif?t=1773858175\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/extras/84879ff841245217b9bc129eb517546f.webm?t=1773858175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/extras/84879ff841245217b9bc129eb517546f.mp4?t=1773858175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every threat can be met with a blade. Now you can raise your weapon and open fire in narrow corridors or the ruins\u2019 shadowed corners. Every bullet is precious\u2014both a last resort for survival and a decisive tool to break deadlock. Precision and restraint matter far more than blind spray-and-pray, for each shot may determine life or death. Yet every gunshot also draws the gaze of the unknown, forcing you to weigh the risk of silence against carving a bloody path with firepower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Clash at Close Quarters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/extras/955b4f81a4d4d1f96624583af92a472e.poster.avif?t=1773858175\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/extras/955b4f81a4d4d1f96624583af92a472e.webm?t=1773858175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/extras/955b4f81a4d4d1f96624583af92a472e.mp4?t=1773858175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Danger never announces itself. It strikes from the shadows in the moments you least expect. With no heavy armor to shield you, only a worn blade and your reflexes stand between you and death. Every duel is decided in the space between breath and steel\u2014one mistake, and your journey ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Move in Silence</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/extras/39e1d0cbcdaa271df08a0edd7681d2fd.poster.avif?t=1773858175\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/extras/39e1d0cbcdaa271df08a0edd7681d2fd.webm?t=1773858175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/extras/39e1d0cbcdaa271df08a0edd7681d2fd.mp4?t=1773858175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some places punish a head-on approach with certain death. You\u2019ll learn to hold your breath, to slip through the shadows beyond an enemy\u2019s gaze. You\u2019ll wait for their footsteps to fade before you advance. Stealth isn\u2019t weakness\u2014it\u2019s another kind of blade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Alter Your Appearance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/extras/0173fbe3053ed6ba5e74804f631700d1.poster.avif?t=1773858175\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/extras/0173fbe3053ed6ba5e74804f631700d1.webm?t=1773858175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/extras/0173fbe3053ed6ba5e74804f631700d1.mp4?t=1773858175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this treacherous wasteland, appearance is more than cover\u2014it\u2019s a weapon. Scavenge abandoned clothing, salvage discarded gear, and reshape your outline and presence. Blend into the crowd or mislead watchful eyes; every change is a race against death, a craft of survival through disguise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Zombie Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/extras/ab043c688f9a3baf91e5bbd5a60ae68a.poster.avif?t=1773858175\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/extras/ab043c688f9a3baf91e5bbd5a60ae68a.webm?t=1773858175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/extras/ab043c688f9a3baf91e5bbd5a60ae68a.mp4?t=1773858175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The undead are no longer bound to a single look. You can alter their appearance\u2014tattered clothes, ruined gear, or eerie ornaments\u2014to shape zombies into grotesque figures with unique presence. These changes don\u2019t just add variety; they heighten the sense of dread, ensuring that every encounter feels unsettling and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A journey of survival, truth, and choice begins here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3929590?t=1773858175","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3929590?t=1773858175","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/9c5d83bd32f664186f8f3bf20283848880809c22/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773858175","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/9c5d83bd32f664186f8f3bf20283848880809c22/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773858175","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"There is a small amount of violence in the game. It is purely for entertainment purposes \u2014 please do not imitate it in real life."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Step into the Unknown</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/extras/56e0eb8cae46d1b8535c13bbb73e3a43.poster.avif?t=1773858175\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/extras/56e0eb8cae46d1b8535c13bbb73e3a43.webm?t=1773858175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/extras/56e0eb8cae46d1b8535c13bbb73e3a43.mp4?t=1773858175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You push open a half-closed door, the floor beneath your feet glinting cold in the dim light. The air is thick with the scent of dust and old paper, each step feeling like a trespass into untouched time. The corridor twists and winds ahead, shadows swaying on the walls. You can\u2019t foresee what lies beyond\u2014only your instincts and a faint glimmer will guide you forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock the Mechanisms</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/extras/f55316cf15929f19fc32d89030b02113.poster.avif?t=1773858175\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/extras/f55316cf15929f19fc32d89030b02113.webm?t=1773858175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/extras/f55316cf15929f19fc32d89030b02113.mp4?t=1773858175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The path ahead is blocked not only by rusted locks but by secrets long buried. You turn a combination lock, study the subtle grooves of its numbers, and wait for that barely audible <i>click</i>. Each puzzle solved peels back another layer of fog, revealing new paths\u2014and truths\u2014hidden within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Firepower Counterattack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/extras/84879ff841245217b9bc129eb517546f.poster.avif?t=1773858175\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/extras/84879ff841245217b9bc129eb517546f.webm?t=1773858175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/extras/84879ff841245217b9bc129eb517546f.mp4?t=1773858175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every threat can be met with a blade. Now you can raise your weapon and open fire in narrow corridors or the ruins\u2019 shadowed corners. Every bullet is precious\u2014both a last resort for survival and a decisive tool to break deadlock. Precision and restraint matter far more than blind spray-and-pray, for each shot may determine life or death. Yet every gunshot also draws the gaze of the unknown, forcing you to weigh the risk of silence against carving a bloody path with firepower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Clash at Close Quarters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/extras/955b4f81a4d4d1f96624583af92a472e.poster.avif?t=1773858175\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/extras/955b4f81a4d4d1f96624583af92a472e.webm?t=1773858175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/extras/955b4f81a4d4d1f96624583af92a472e.mp4?t=1773858175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Danger never announces itself. It strikes from the shadows in the moments you least expect. With no heavy armor to shield you, only a worn blade and your reflexes stand between you and death. Every duel is decided in the space between breath and steel\u2014one mistake, and your journey ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Move in Silence</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/extras/39e1d0cbcdaa271df08a0edd7681d2fd.poster.avif?t=1773858175\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/extras/39e1d0cbcdaa271df08a0edd7681d2fd.webm?t=1773858175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/extras/39e1d0cbcdaa271df08a0edd7681d2fd.mp4?t=1773858175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some places punish a head-on approach with certain death. You\u2019ll learn to hold your breath, to slip through the shadows beyond an enemy\u2019s gaze. You\u2019ll wait for their footsteps to fade before you advance. Stealth isn\u2019t weakness\u2014it\u2019s another kind of blade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Alter Your Appearance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/extras/0173fbe3053ed6ba5e74804f631700d1.poster.avif?t=1773858175\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/extras/0173fbe3053ed6ba5e74804f631700d1.webm?t=1773858175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/extras/0173fbe3053ed6ba5e74804f631700d1.mp4?t=1773858175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this treacherous wasteland, appearance is more than cover\u2014it\u2019s a weapon. Scavenge abandoned clothing, salvage discarded gear, and reshape your outline and presence. Blend into the crowd or mislead watchful eyes; every change is a race against death, a craft of survival through disguise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Zombie Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/extras/ab043c688f9a3baf91e5bbd5a60ae68a.poster.avif?t=1773858175\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/extras/ab043c688f9a3baf91e5bbd5a60ae68a.webm?t=1773858175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/extras/ab043c688f9a3baf91e5bbd5a60ae68a.mp4?t=1773858175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The undead are no longer bound to a single look. You can alter their appearance\u2014tattered clothes, ruined gear, or eerie ornaments\u2014to shape zombies into grotesque figures with unique presence. These changes don\u2019t just add variety; they heighten the sense of dread, ensuring that every encounter feels unsettling and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A journey of survival, truth, and choice begins here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Game Never Sleep"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929590/94e8646a0276dd7b875188c6454fb741fb7c58e3/header.jpg?t=1773858175","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3929590/243743804/4e4925d96f7cab2d454cb45d745f95d3fdb37fae/1773853990/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773857348","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3929590/243743804/4e4925d96f7cab2d454cb45d745f95d3fdb37fae/1773853990/dash_h264.mpd?t=1773857348","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3929590/243743804/4e4925d96f7cab2d454cb45d745f95d3fdb37fae/1773853990/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1773857348","id":257291188,"name":"Biohazard Maiden PV","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257291188/c32a83e7fd38c4d30841514a98f35d0358c7785c/movie_600x33